            Creatine is the rare supplement whose evidence matches its reputation, and the dose that works is small: 3 to 5 g of creatine monohydrate a day, taken consistently. A protein powder with creatine is worth buying only if it delivers that dose clearly on the label and fits the way you actually drink shakes. Nitro-Tech, Orgain, Sunwarrior, Myprotein's clear blend, Vega and Serious Mass all clear that bar on current labels.
